BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beginner Crochet - December
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261213T160000
UID:bistitchual-10520275910914@bistitchual.ca
DESCRIPTION:This listing is for a two session Beginner Crochet Course. The
  classes will be held in person at Bistitchual on Sunday December 13th and
  20th from 2:30pm-4:00pm FOR DECEMBER ONLY\, WE ARE OFFERING 20% OFF CLASS
 ES!! Learn the fundamentals of crochet in this two part class. We will be 
 covering chaining and single crochet\, as well as double and half-double c
 rochets. Don’t know what any of that means? Great\, you’re in the righ
 t place! We’ll provide all the materials\, including a simple pattern th
 at teaches you common terms and instructions you’ll encounter in most cr
 ochet projects. We will also discuss how to choose the appropriate yarn an
 d hook for a project as well as where you can take your crafting after you
  master these basic techniques. There’s a lot to learn\, and we’re exc
 ited to accompany your beginning in the wonderful craft of crochet! Materi
 als are included! - 50g ball of worsted weight cotton in your choice of co
 lour - 6mm crochet hook Our class size is capped at 4 people\, so everyone
  can receive the attention they need. Anna will share lots of tips and tec
 hniques to get you well on your way. About the instructor: If idle hands a
 re the Devil’s tools\, he hasn’t much to do with Anna (she/they.) Anna
 ’s grandmother taught her to knit as a toddler and she hasn’t put the 
 yarn down since. Knitting\, crochet\, spinning\, dyeing\, embroidery\, han
 d sewing\, machine sewing - Anna has a voracious appetite for learning new
  textile techniques. With a background in textile artifact conservation\, 
 Anna explores the craft\, history\, and science behind fibre arts. Please 
 note that classes will only proceed if we have a minimum of two attendees 
 . If the minimum is not met\, there will be the option for a refund or to 
 reschedule. There will be a four person maximum for each class. Please pre
 -book your spot to let us know you are coming! Cancellation Policy Classes
  must be paid for at the time of registration to reserve your spot. - If c
 ancelled 48 hrs or more prior to the start of the first class will be give
 n a store credit. Classes cancelled less than 48 hrs prior to the start of
  the class will not be reimbursed.
LOCATION:Bistitchual\, 266 Jane St\, Toronto\, ON M6S 3Z2
URL:https://bistitchual.ca/products/beginner-crochet-december-copy
X-SOURCE:Bistitchual
END:VEVENT
